# What goes into the images is listed, not what is left out: a .env with
# real passwords, a local database or an editor's folder lying next to the
# code can then never end up in an image by accident. A new top-level folder
# the application needs has to be added here.
*

!app
!bootstrap
!config
!database
!docker
!lang
!public
!resources
!routes
!tests
!artisan
!composer.json
!composer.lock
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!phpunit.xml
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.js

# Made on this machine, not part of the code: the images make their own.
bootstrap/cache/*
database/*.sqlite*
public/build
public/hot
public/storage
